OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's 'mansion tax' law a    
OL,4,Astep closer as bill published          
OL,6,FScotland's so-called mansion tax has   
OL,7,Fmoved a step closer after ministers    
OL,8,Fpublished a bill at Holyrood.          
OL,10,FUnder the Scottish government's        
OL,11,Fproposals, properties worth more than  
OL,12,F#1m will be put into a new council tax 
OL,13,Fband with higher rates.                
OL,15,FAn estimated 13,000 homes face hikes   
OL,16,Franging from about #700 to #3,600.     
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
