OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's 'mansion tax' law a    
OL,4,Astep closer as bill published          
OL,6,FDeputy First Minister Jenny Gilruth    
OL,7,Fsaid the legislation would "further    
OL,8,Fimprove the fairness of taxation", but 
OL,9,Fthe Conservatives said revenues raised 
OL,10,Fby the tax would "barely touch the     
OL,11,Fsides" of what was required to properly
OL,12,Ffund councils.                         
